      <species id="mwbb6b65c1_1ef7_4576_8d0a_93015cc6f1c1" name="iCAF" compartment="mw95489b1c_3189_4a37_8fd8_00886719783b" initialAmount="0" substanceUnits="MWUSERUNIT_cell" hasOnlySubstanceUnits="true" boundaryCondition="false" constant="false">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Inflammatory cancer-associated fibroblasts. Secrete IL-6 and CCL5, driving MDSC recruitment and M2 polarization. Driven by tumor-derived IL-1alpha; TGFb antagonizes via IL-1R1 repression.</body>
        </notes>
      </species>
      <species id="mw68478ad5_ba76_4cb4_ade9_a0854aad2e20" name="myCAF" compartment="mw95489b1c_3189_4a37_8fd8_00886719783b" initialAmount="0" substanceUnits="MWUSERUNIT_cell" hasOnlySubstanceUnits="true" boundaryCondition="false" constant="false">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Myofibroblastic cancer-associated fibroblasts. Secrete ECM, CXCL12, TGFb, VEGF. Build desmoplastic barrier. Favored by TGFb signaling (Biffi 2019).</body>
        </notes>
      </species>
      <species id="mwb5115d77_d125_44a7_b5ad_f59f85fd226d" name="apCAF" compartment="mw95489b1c_3189_4a37_8fd8_00886719783b" initialAmount="0" substanceUnits="MWUSERUNIT_cell" hasOnlySubstanceUnits="true" boundaryCondition="false" constant="false">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Antigen-presenting cancer-associated fibroblasts. Express MHC-II, present tumor antigen tolerogenically -&gt; Treg induction. Rarest subtype ~2-5% of CAFs (Elyada 2019).</body>
        </notes>
      </species>
      <species id="mw34268814_5fc9_450c_96a2_92fc57397007" name="collagen" compartment="mw95489b1c_3189_4a37_8fd8_00886719783b" initialAmount="0" substanceUnits="MWBUILTINPREFIX_milli_MWBUILTINUNIT_gram" hasOnlySubstanceUnits="true" boundaryCondition="false" constant="false">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Fibrillar collagen (types I/III) in tumor (total mass in mg). Primary structural ECM component driving desmoplasia. Determines pore size (immune exclusion) and stiffness (mechanotransduction).</body>
        </notes>
      </species>
      <species id="mwb54a671d_8e7f_4da2_a8f1_f205ed7fa89b" name="CXCL12" compartment="mw95489b1c_3189_4a37_8fd8_00886719783b" initialConcentration="0" substanceUnits="MWDERIVEDUNIT_nanomolarity_milliliter" hasOnlySubstanceUnits="false" boundaryCondition="false" constant="false">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">CXCL12/SDF-1 chemokine secreted by iCAFs. Major T cell exclusion mechanism in PDAC via CXCR4 signaling (Elyada 2019, Ogawa 2021).</body>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
          <SimBiology xmlns="http://www.mathworks.com">
            <Unit Numerator="nanomolarity"/>
          </SimBiology>
        </annotation>
      </species>
      <species id="mwb47c66e2_20e0_4131_91c3_5a7c06e4e524" name="IL6" compartment="mw95489b1c_3189_4a37_8fd8_00886719783b" initialConcentration="0" substanceUnits="MWDERIVEDUNIT_nanomolarity_milliliter" hasOnlySubstanceUnits="false" boundaryCondition="false" constant="false">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Interleukin-6 inflammatory cytokine secreted by iCAFs. Promotes MDSC recruitment, M2 polarization, tumor progression.</body>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
          <SimBiology xmlns="http://www.mathworks.com">
            <Unit Numerator="nanomolarity"/>
          </SimBiology>
        </annotation>
      </species>
      <species id="mw0768cbb4_f979_4040_a5f1_03cd457cdd0e" name="IL1" compartment="mw95489b1c_3189_4a37_8fd8_00886719783b" initialConcentration="0" substanceUnits="MWDERIVEDUNIT_nanomolarity_milliliter" hasOnlySubstanceUnits="false" boundaryCondition="false" constant="false">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Interleukin-1alpha in tumor compartment. Tumor-derived; drives iCAF formation via NF-kB/LIF/JAK-STAT3. TGFb antagonizes signaling by downregulating IL-1R1.</body>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
          <SimBiology xmlns="http://www.mathworks.com">
            <Unit Numerator="nanomolarity"/>
          </SimBiology>
        </annotation>
