      <parameter id="mw47be6ef0_53e4_4547_bc04_d313fa29dea3" name="f_stroma_max" value="2.43" units="dimensionless" constant="true">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Max CAF:cancer ratio — total carrying-capacity budget partitioned across iCAF/myCAF/apCAF</body>
        </notes>
      </parameter>
      <parameter id="mw4ab23cad_a382_41b8_ae55_e736fb034b78" name="f_apCAF_of_total" value="0.1" units="dimensionless" constant="true">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">apCAF share of the total CAF carrying capacity. Default 0.1 from Elyada 2019 Fig 5D (apCAFs ~10% of PDAC CAFs). Free parameter in the stick-breaking simplex parameterization (paired with f_iCAF_of_non_apCAF).</body>
        </notes>
      </parameter>
      <parameter id="mw2826f52d_8bd3_46f9_964e_7ead120b467d" name="f_iCAF_of_non_apCAF" value="0.222" units="dimensionless" constant="true">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">iCAF share of the non-apCAF CAF mass (stick-breaking second step). Default 0.222 from Elyada 2019 Fig 5D — myCAF 0.7 + iCAF 0.2 of total → iCAF/(iCAF+myCAF) = 0.2/0.9 = 0.222. Free parameter in the stick-breaking simplex parameterization (paired with f_apCAF_of_total).</body>
        </notes>
      </parameter>
